      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Please know that those feelings of wanting to disappear are symptoms of deep pain, not truths about your value. The idea that letting go would make things easier for others is a dangerous thought pattern that depression often creates. Your life has intrinsic worth, regardless of how you feel right now. Please connect with someone immediately, such as calling or texting 988 in the US and Canada, so you can receive immediate, compassionate help.",
      "source": "target",
